# Copied unchanged from deployment/quickstart/seed/data/audit.log.raw. The two seeds share a line
# format on purpose, so a data file can move between them without editing.
#
# Messages for audit.log.raw. THESE ARE NOT JSON.
#
# This topic exists so the message browser is forced to show a value it cannot parse. Half the
# lines are logfmt (key=value pairs, the format used by a lot of Go services), the other half are
# a plain application log line with no structure at all. Neither has a key or headers: this is
# what a log shipper writes when it is simply forwarding text.
#
# If KUI ever renders one of these as "invalid JSON" or as an error, that is a bug, and this topic
# is how you find it in ten seconds instead of in a support ticket.
#mode: value-only

